(7502911, 1195954, 124815, '<td valign="top">Marvelous light and good, economic processing</td>', 'Marvelous light and good, economic processing', '2017-03-01 10:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502912, 1196088, 124815, '<td valign="top">So painterly! Congratulations!</td>', 'So painterly! Congratulations!', '2017-03-01 10:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502913, 1195304, 124815, '<td valign="top">Yes. And almost ignoring each other, caught in their personal splendor</td>', 'Yes. And almost ignoring each other, caught in their personal splendor', '2017-03-01 10:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502914, 1196081, 124815, '<td valign="top">A jewel</td>', 'A jewel', '2017-03-01 10:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502922, 1195879, 124815, '<td valign="top">Amazing place but the extra sharpening diminishes the image a lot</td>', 'Amazing place but the extra sharpening diminishes the image a lot', '2017-03-01 11:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502923, 1195728, 124815, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot! It''s not only the subject but the entire composition of the image and the muted greys. The feeling of surprise comes from all of these elements. Congratulations.<br/>10</td>', 'Terrific shot! It''s not only the subject but the entire composition of the image and the muted greys. The feeling of surprise comes from all of these elements. Congratulations.10', '2017-03-01 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502930, 1196194, 163081, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great picture. The bombastic clouds overpowering the sea that just don''t overcast the sand dunes which are lit by the low sun. In my top 3, a 9 from me, and my Yellow Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Wow, this is a great picture. The bombastic clouds overpowering the sea that just don''t overcast the sand dunes which are lit by the low sun. In my top 3, a 9 from me, and my Yellow Dragon Award', '2017-03-01 12:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502931, 1195610, 163081, '<td valign="top">Amazing scene well taken, I love the framing and that you have kept mushroom completely. There is quite a lot of negative space but it compensates with the overall colors. An 8 from me and in my top 5</td>', 'Amazing scene well taken, I love the framing and that you have kept mushroom completely. There is quite a lot of negative space but it compensates with the overall colors. An 8 from me and in my top 5', '2017-03-01 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502980, 1196183, 101668, '<td valign="top">So pretty</td>', 'So pretty', '2017-03-01 14:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502990, 1196093, 186753, '<td valign="top">This one the title informs the image and transforms it from a standard dog on the beach shot to something more visceral. Then the sling is no longer a distraction but an important piece of the puzzle. Very sorry for the loss.</td>', 'This one the title informs the image and transforms it from a standard dog on the beach shot to something more visceral. Then the sling is no longer a distraction but an important piece of the puzzle. Very sorry for the loss.', '2017-03-01 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502991, 1196226, 186753, '<td valign="top">Here again the title makes an interesting image even more so</td>', 'Here again the title makes an interesting image even more so', '2017-03-01 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502992, 1195628, 186753, '<td valign="top">clever title.</td>', 'clever title.', '2017-03-01 16:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502995, 1195595, 186753, '<td valign="top">I think I know this horse.</td>', 'I think I know this horse.', '2017-03-01 16:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502996, 1196133, 186753, '<td valign="top">would prefer to see slightly more prop blur on this bird to help us feel the flight</td>', 'would prefer to see slightly more prop blur on this bird to help us feel the flight', '2017-03-01 16:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7502997, 1195859, 186753, '<td valign="top">I love this subject, I love the framing, I love the moment, but the light is not flattering to such a wonderful subject. Would love to see you shoot this again with long raking light and a colorful sky.</td>', 'I love this subject, I love the framing, I love the moment, but the light is not flattering to such a wonderful subject. Would love to see you shoot this again with long raking light and a colorful sky.', '2017-03-01 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503112, 1196223, 114225, '<td valign="top">Classic image. Good use of leading lines and foreground.</td>', 'Classic image. Good use of leading lines and foreground.', '2017-03-02 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503113, 1195933, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is good. One thing I would suggest is maybe darkening the foreground a bit. It''s currently lighter than the main subject, which pulls the eyes down.</td>', 'Overall, this is good. One thing I would suggest is maybe darkening the foreground a bit. It''s currently lighter than the main subject, which pulls the eyes down.', '2017-03-02 09:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503114, 1196183, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool view of a cool structure. IS it just me, or is the vignetting incredibly strong here?</td>', 'Cool view of a cool structure. IS it just me, or is the vignetting incredibly strong here?', '2017-03-02 09:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503115, 1196044, 114225, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, but not great either. Some things you could have likely done in post to help:<br/>1. Reduce noise. There is a lot of it in the sky.<br/>2. Remove the purple fringing on the branches.<br/>3. Brighten up the head of the bird to made it stand out a little more.</td>', 'Not a bad photo, but not great either. Some things you could have likely done in post to help:1. Reduce noise. There is a lot of it in the sky.2. Remove the purple fringing on the branches.3. Brighten up the head of the bird to made it stand out a little more.', '2017-03-02 09:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503116, 1196227, 114225, '<td valign="top">That little bit of fog is what really helps this image nail it.</td>', 'That little bit of fog is what really helps this image nail it.', '2017-03-02 09:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503120, 1195610, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool image. Nice job darkening the background to highlight your subject better. I might suggest cropping out a bunch of the right side of the image, as it doesn''t add any value.</td>', 'What a cool image. Nice job darkening the background to highlight your subject better. I might suggest cropping out a bunch of the right side of the image, as it doesn''t add any value.', '2017-03-02 10:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503123, 1195986, 114225, '<td valign="top">This could be a cool image if it was in focus.</td>', 'This could be a cool image if it was in focus.', '2017-03-02 10:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503124, 1195846, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of pastels in this scene.</td>', 'Nice use of pastels in this scene.', '2017-03-02 10:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503125, 1196069, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool spot for a photo, but something is throwing me. Maybe it''s the not quite natural colors. Maybe it''s too much clarity in the sky. Not sure.</td>', 'Cool spot for a photo, but something is throwing me. Maybe it''s the not quite natural colors. Maybe it''s too much clarity in the sky. Not sure.', '2017-03-02 10:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503126, 1195649, 114225, '<td valign="top">If this was nicely focused, this would be really nice.</td>', 'If this was nicely focused, this would be really nice.', '2017-03-02 10:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503127, 1195821, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m curious at your choice in composition. She is looking to the right (her left), but most of your "empty space" in the photo is on the left (her right). I would prefer if we could see more in the direction that she is looking.</td>', 'I''m curious at your choice in composition. She is looking to the right (her left), but most of your "empty space" in the photo is on the left (her right). I would prefer if we could see more in the direction that she is looking.', '2017-03-02 10:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503129, 1196013, 114225, '<td valign="top">I love the scene. The tones. The focus. The lines.<br/> <br/>Cutting off the top of the tree seems odd to me. Seems like it was a mistake. I feel like you either need to include the whole tree, or crop it down further so it doesn''t feel so strange.<br/> <br/>Still good.</td>', 'I love the scene. The tones. The focus. The lines. Cutting off the top of the tree seems odd to me. Seems like it was a mistake. I feel like you either need to include the whole tree, or crop it down further so it doesn''t feel so strange. Still good.', '2017-03-02 10:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503130, 1195999, 114225, '<td valign="top">First thing my eyes went to were those water spots in the upper left.</td>', 'First thing my eyes went to were those water spots in the upper left.', '2017-03-02 10:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503132, 1196167, 114225, '<td valign="top">This image just doesn''t have much to it for me to really enjoy. Some cruddy buildings in cruddy weather.</td>', 'This image just doesn''t have much to it for me to really enjoy. Some cruddy buildings in cruddy weather.', '2017-03-02 10:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503134, 1196153, 114225, '<td valign="top">First thing my eye went to was that water sport on the left. Fixing that would help a lot.</td>', 'First thing my eye went to was that water sport on the left. Fixing that would help a lot.', '2017-03-02 10:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503136, 1195775, 114225, '<td valign="top">Is it me, or does the horizon look tilted just slightly?</td>', 'Is it me, or does the horizon look tilted just slightly?', '2017-03-02 10:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503138, 1196205, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, good image. Nice composition, nice exposure.<br/> <br/>One thing that is bothering me is the rocks in the background. I''m not sure if this is an artifact of resizing or sharpening, but I see a lot of 90 degree corners, something that nature doesn''t provide that much of. If you don''t see what I''m seeing, I''m happy to take a screenshot and draw a circle around it.</td>', 'Overall, good image. Nice composition, nice exposure. One thing that is bothering me is the rocks in the background. I''m not sure if this is an artifact of resizing or sharpening, but I see a lot of 90 degree corners, something that nature doesn''t provide that much of. If you don''t see what I''m seeing, I''m happy to take a screenshot and draw a circle around it.', '2017-03-02 10:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503139, 1196124, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hah! Fun stuff.<br/> <br/>My one nit pick would be to crop out a majority of that sky.</td>', 'Hah! Fun stuff. My one nit pick would be to crop out a majority of that sky.', '2017-03-02 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503141, 1196199, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hah! Excellent setup.<br/> <br/>My nitpick on this image would be the sky. I have a feeling it didn''t look oddly grey, likely more of a bright white overcast. And you pulled down the highlights so much that it caused a greyish tint to appear.</td>', 'Hah! Excellent setup. My nitpick on this image would be the sky. I have a feeling it didn''t look oddly grey, likely more of a bright white overcast. And you pulled down the highlights so much that it caused a greyish tint to appear.', '2017-03-02 10:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503142, 1195459, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like maybe you missed focus a bit, because hit skin looks plasticy (I know the water plays into that as well).</td>', 'Looks like maybe you missed focus a bit, because hit skin looks plasticy (I know the water plays into that as well).', '2017-03-02 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503208, 1196194, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of later afternoon light and nice composition.<br/> <br/>My nit pick here would be the sky. It has so much clarity to it that it looks like it''s just as close to the foreground as the foreground is. But that''s not true. Try this with knocking down the clarity in the sky.</td>', 'Good use of later afternoon light and nice composition. My nit pick here would be the sky. It has so much clarity to it that it looks like it''s just as close to the foreground as the foreground is. But that''s not true. Try this with knocking down the clarity in the sky.', '2017-03-02 14:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503209, 1195561, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think your white balance may be a bit skewed towards the cools here.</td>', 'I think your white balance may be a bit skewed towards the cools here.', '2017-03-02 14:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503210, 1196209, 114225, '<td valign="top">Heavy white vignette is never a good thing in my opinion. Instead, why not just crop tightly?</td>', 'Heavy white vignette is never a good thing in my opinion. Instead, why not just crop tightly?', '2017-03-02 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503211, 1195948, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m really yearning for the foreground to be in focus here.</td>', 'I''m really yearning for the foreground to be in focus here.', '2017-03-02 14:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503212, 1195529, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think the dark grey background really hurts this. I don''t mind the idea of a rim light here, but the background and floor being kind of lit gives this the impression of underexposed (not a pun!)</td>', 'I think the dark grey background really hurts this. I don''t mind the idea of a rim light here, but the background and floor being kind of lit gives this the impression of underexposed (not a pun!)', '2017-03-02 14:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503213, 1195998, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo has some pretty glaring technical flaws (the grey bits where there once was highlights, the blurriness), but it makes up for it with emotion.</td>', 'This photo has some pretty glaring technical flaws (the grey bits where there once was highlights, the blurriness), but it makes up for it with emotion.', '2017-03-02 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7503214, 1195926, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a nice image. I love the way the light falls. I want to see this with more warmth in it, but that''s just my personal style.</td>', 'What a nice image. I love the way the light falls. I want to see this with more warmth in it, but that''s just my personal style.', '2017-03-02 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
