(7504101, 1195879, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene that just got killed in post. Over sharp and over saturated by a long stretch. This is a wonderful composition. If there''s a challenge where you get to reprocess a previous entry go with this one - there''s at least an HM in here.</td>', 'Lovely scene that just got killed in post. Over sharp and over saturated by a long stretch. This is a wonderful composition. If there''s a challenge where you get to reprocess a previous entry go with this one - there''s at least an HM in here.', '2017-03-06 14:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
