(7504330, 1195879, 79955, '<td valign="top">Finally a NICE TOP 10 finish ..... but not position 8 , so still need to improve !! (personal joke with Chris)</td>', 'Finally a NICE TOP 10 finish ..... but not position 8 , so still need to improve !! (personal joke with Chris)', '2017-03-08 00:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504331, 1196213, 100831, '<td valign="top">I was your nine. Such a fun photo.</td>', 'I was your nine. Such a fun photo.', '2017-03-08 00:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504332, 1195954, 185714, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Yellow Ribbon.  Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on your Yellow Ribbon.  Well done!', '2017-03-08 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504333, 1195954, 185697, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!</td>', 'Congratulations!!', '2017-03-08 01:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504334, 1196227, 170018, '<td valign="top">Aloha, dear Lev!<br/>I could not stop laughing for few minutes! Ok, may be not really laughing, but certainly be amazed by the fact how our world is so tiny!<br/>This could have been my submission for free study if I had not lost track of time...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1196488" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1196488.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1196488.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1196488.jpg"/></a> <br/>And I even saw you! I forgot where exactly, probably some market, but I told my husband that there''s a person who looks exactly like Lev Tsimring! Too bad you''ve disappeared too quickly...<br/>Life is funny! :-)</td>', 'Aloha, dear Lev!I could not stop laughing for few minutes! Ok, may be not really laughing, but certainly be amazed by the fact how our world is so tiny!This could have been my submission for free study if I had not lost track of time... And I even saw you! I forgot where exactly, probably some market, but I told my husband that there''s a person who looks exactly like Lev Tsimring! Too bad you''ve disappeared too quickly...Life is funny! :-)', '2017-03-08 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504335, 1195610, 185714, '<td valign="top">Congratulations to your TT<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations to your TT Well done!', '2017-03-08 01:27:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504356, 1195879, 185772, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JakeKurdsjuk:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely scene that just got killed in post. Over sharp and over saturated by a long stretch. This is a wonderful composition. If there''s a challenge where you get to reprocess a previous entry go with this one - there''s at least an HM in here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your valuable feedback. Will work on improving it. Thanks</td>', 'Originally posted by JakeKurdsjuk: Lovely scene that just got killed in post. Over sharp and over saturated by a long stretch. This is a wonderful composition. If there''s a challenge where you get to reprocess a previous entry go with this one - there''s at least an HM in here.   Thank you for your valuable feedback. Will work on improving it. Thanks', '2017-03-08 02:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504357, 1195879, 185772, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by andrewt:</b></div><hr/><i> Finally a NICE TOP 10 finish ..... but not position 8 , so still need to improve !! (personal joke with Chris) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Andrew. Working hard to improve.</td>', 'Originally posted by andrewt: Finally a NICE TOP 10 finish ..... but not position 8 , so still need to improve !! (personal joke with Chris)   Thanks Andrew. Working hard to improve.', '2017-03-08 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504358, 1196201, 50641, '<td valign="top">As seen from space.</td>', 'As seen from space.', '2017-03-08 02:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504359, 1196196, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just returned from Finland where we got one viewing of the Aurora. Magnificent. Is it more consistent (weather/etc.) in Iceland? Or is luck just as much as anywhere else?</td>', 'Just returned from Finland where we got one viewing of the Aurora. Magnificent. Is it more consistent (weather/etc.) in Iceland? Or is luck just as much as anywhere else?', '2017-03-08 03:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504361, 1195954, 102278, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.</td>', 'Fabulous.', '2017-03-08 04:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504362, 1196093, 135744, '<td valign="top">We lost our beloved Fergal last week. This photo was taken a few weeks before and was his last visit to the beach. He was diagnosed with a degenerative condition about 4 years ago and only in the last few weeks has it taken him off his legs. It was with great sadness we had to say our goodbyes. He was one of a kind.<br/> <br/>We have another dog, Molly and our belief is they love company so we have a new addition to the household - Hegarty. He will never replace Fergal but he will help ease the pain.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1196492" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1196492.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1196492.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1196492.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'We lost our beloved Fergal last week. This photo was taken a few weeks before and was his last visit to the beach. He was diagnosed with a degenerative condition about 4 years ago and only in the last few weeks has it taken him off his legs. It was with great sadness we had to say our goodbyes. He was one of a kind. We have another dog, Molly and our belief is they love company so we have a new addition to the household - Hegarty. He will never replace Fergal but he will help ease the pain.   ', '2017-03-08 04:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504363, 1196088, 135744, '<td valign="top">Way to go Kees. Well done mate - that is a superb photo and you sure deserve that ribbon.</td>', 'Way to go Kees. Well done mate - that is a superb photo and you sure deserve that ribbon.', '2017-03-08 04:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504364, 1196088, 147314, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> Way to go Kees. Well done mate - that is a superb photo and you sure deserve that ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Paul. To be honest, I''m quite surprised to get a ribbon with a 6.6 in a FS. I expected it to end somewhere between 10th and 15th place. I think the scenery in this image is superb, but the light is off IMO. When I walked uphill to get the shot I had beautiful light and sun rays coming through the clouds, but nothing of this when I took the shot. So I wasn''t too happy with the shot myself, but apparently I''m too critical ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Way to go Kees. Well done mate - that is a superb photo and you sure deserve that ribbon.  Thanks Paul. To be honest, I''m quite surprised to get a ribbon with a 6.6 in a FS. I expected it to end somewhere between 10th and 15th place. I think the scenery in this image is superb, but the light is off IMO. When I walked uphill to get the shot I had beautiful light and sun rays coming through the clouds, but nothing of this when I took the shot. So I wasn''t too happy with the shot myself, but apparently I''m too critical ;-)', '2017-03-08 04:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504365, 1196196, 80058, '<td valign="top">Magic</td>', 'Magic', '2017-03-08 05:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504366, 1196088, 80058, '<td valign="top">Did you use a Gradual/ND filter at all?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-03-08 05:07:09.</i></td>', 'Did you use a Gradual/ND filter at all?', '2017-03-08 05:06:50.000000', '2017-03-08 05:07:09.000000', 0),
(7504367, 1195610, 80058, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, what a moment to capture!</td>', 'Love the composition, what a moment to capture!', '2017-03-08 05:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504368, 1196088, 147314, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by booboo_goon:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you use a Gradual/ND filter at all? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, first I used the Graduated Filter tool in Lightroom and later on I used the GND filter in NIK Collection Software.</td>', 'Originally posted by booboo_goon: Did you use a Gradual/ND filter at all?  Yes, first I used the Graduated Filter tool in Lightroom and later on I used the GND filter in NIK Collection Software.', '2017-03-08 05:19:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504373, 1196183, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> Cool view of a cool structure. IS it just me, or is the vignetting incredibly strong here? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Do me a favor and let me know if you think the vignetting is still strong now that it can be viewed at full size. On my MacBook Pro the horizontal 1200px gets slightly squeezed and after seeing your comment I agreed with it and thought "why hadn''t I seen that?", but now that I''m seeing it at full res again there''s details I see that got lost in the compression. It was a heavy vignette to try and deal with some distractions in the corners but I thought I was careful not to overdo it. Perhaps not.</td>', 'Originally posted by giantmike: Cool view of a cool structure. IS it just me, or is the vignetting incredibly strong here?   Do me a favor and let me know if you think the vignetting is still strong now that it can be viewed at full size. On my MacBook Pro the horizontal 1200px gets slightly squeezed and after seeing your comment I agreed with it and thought "why hadn''t I seen that?", but now that I''m seeing it at full res again there''s details I see that got lost in the compression. It was a heavy vignette to try and deal with some distractions in the corners but I thought I was careful not to overdo it. Perhaps not.', '2017-03-08 06:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504374, 1196088, 113411, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Kees.!!!</td>', 'Congratulations, Kees.!!!', '2017-03-08 07:03:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504375, 1196093, 147314, '<td valign="top">Sorry to hear about your loss, Paul. Dogs are so part of your life that losing one is very hard. Luckily we can remember them with pictures like this. And I hope you''ll have a great time with Hegarty, what a lovely wee dog he is!</td>', 'Sorry to hear about your loss, Paul. Dogs are so part of your life that losing one is very hard. Luckily we can remember them with pictures like this. And I hope you''ll have a great time with Hegarty, what a lovely wee dog he is!', '2017-03-08 07:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504377, 1195954, 185795, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the encouragement</td>', 'Thanks all for the encouragement', '2017-03-08 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504379, 1196088, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by booboo_goon:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you use a Gradual/ND filter at all? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, first I used the Graduated Filter tool in Lightroom and later on I used the GND filter in NIK Collection Software. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Fab work! Well done</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: Originally posted by booboo_goon: Did you use a Gradual/ND filter at all?  Yes, first I used the Graduated Filter tool in Lightroom and later on I used the GND filter in NIK Collection Software.   Fab work! Well done', '2017-03-08 07:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504381, 1195691, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love the gradually building activity.</td>', 'Love the gradually building activity.', '2017-03-08 08:04:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7504382, 1196201, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love negative trees!</td>', 'I love negative trees!', '2017-03-08 08:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
