(7504551, 1195802, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m delighted to read that this was a natural capture (I know pretty much most of your shots are - but didn''t know who the photog was until after results).  Frankly, I''m a bit jealous.  Would LOVE to be able to find, let alone get close enough, to capture a decent owl photo.  It''s on my bucket list.</td>', 'I''m delighted to read that this was a natural capture (I know pretty much most of your shots are - but didn''t know who the photog was until after results).  Frankly, I''m a bit jealous.  Would LOVE to be able to find, let alone get close enough, to capture a decent owl photo.  It''s on my bucket list.', '2017-03-09 07:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
